### 4.6 REQ-LENS-010-006: Error Message Enrichment

**Status**: To Be Implemented
**Priority**: Medium

**Rationale**: Enriching error messages with context enables faster understanding and resolution

**Configuration**:
- Automatic context injection (related logs, metrics, configurations)
- Related log aggregation (gather logs from related components)
- Metric correlation (CPU, memory, network at time of error)
- Historical similar incident linking (reference past incidents)
- Knowledge base integration (link to relevant documentation)

**Implementation Details**:
```javascript
// Error enrichment example
function enrichError(errorMessage) {
  const enrichedError = {
    original_error: errorMessage,
    timestamp: errorMessage.timestamp,
    severity: classifyErrorSeverity(errorMessage),

    // Context injection
    context: {
      affected_components: identifyAffectedComponents(errorMessage),
      current_state: getCurrentSystemState(errorMessage.components),
      recent_changes: getRecentChanges(errorMessage.timestamp, window='1 hour')
    },

    // Related logs
    related_logs: {
      before: getLogsAround(errorMessage.timestamp, window='-5 minutes'),
      after: getLogsAround(errorMessage.timestamp, window='+5 minutes'),
      same_component: getComponentLogs(errorMessage.component, window='10 minutes')
    },

    // Metric correlation
    metrics_at_error_time: {
      cpu_usage: getCPUMetrics(errorMessage.host, errorMessage.timestamp),
      memory_usage: getMemoryMetrics(errorMessage.host, errorMessage.timestamp),
      network_io: getNetworkMetrics(errorMessage.host, errorMessage.timestamp),
      kafka_metrics: getKafkaMetrics(errorMessage.timestamp)
    },

    // Historical incidents
    similar_incidents: findSimilarIncidents(errorMessage, limit=5),

    // Knowledge base
    relevant_docs: searchKnowledgeBase(errorMessage.signature),
    troubleshooting_guide: getTroubleshootingGuide(errorMessage.type),

    // Suggested actions
    recommended_actions: generateRecommendations(errorMessage, context, similar_incidents)
  };

  return enrichedError;
}
```

**Validation**:
- Enrichment completes within 5 seconds
- Related logs accurately gathered (>90% relevance)
- Similar incident suggestions helpful (>60% match quality)

